hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1623.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1623.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1624.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Abi Unaysa that Abd al-Hamid ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn al-Khattab informed him from Muslim ibn Yasar al-Juhani that Umar ibn al-Khattab was asked about this ayat - \"\"When your Lord took their progeny from the Banu Adam from their backs and made them testify against themselves. 'Am I not your Lord?' They said"
"1624.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Abi Unaysa that Abd al-Hamid ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn al-Khattab informed him from Muslim ibn Yasar al-Juhani that Umar ibn al-Khattab was asked about this ayat - \"\"When your Lord took their progeny from the Banu Adam from their backs and made them testify against themselves. 'Am I not your Lord?' They said"
"1625.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1625.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1626.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ziyad ibn Sad from Amr ibn Muslim that Tawus al-Yamani said"
"1626.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ziyad ibn Sad from Amr ibn Muslim that Tawus al-Yamani said"
"1627.1","Malik related to me from Ziyad ibn Sad that Amr ibn Dinar said"
"1627.2","Malik related to me from Ziyad ibn Sad that Amr ibn Dinar said"
"1628.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that his paternal uncle"
"1628.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that his paternal uncle"
"1629.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1629.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1630.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Ziyad that Muhammad ibn Kab al-Quradhi said"
"1630.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Ziyad that Muhammad ibn Kab al-Quradhi said"
"1631.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that this was said \"\"Praise be to Allah who created everything as is necessary"
"1631.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that this was said \"\"Praise be to Allah who created everything as is necessary"
"1632.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that this was said \"\"No one will die until his provision is completed for him"
"1632.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that this was said \"\"No one will die until his provision is completed for him"
